## Authority boundary

This document and the generated Rust tables carry no runtime actuation
authority. A `Do` classification records that the operation *can* cause a
consequence, not that any caller is permitted to cause it. Consequential DO
remains behind GymAct/BRCE admission and autofde-lab's own runtime gate.
